    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0532" n="436" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg436"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr. Hill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Having been instructed by my Government to reorganize the Italian immigration
                    bureau before December 30, it is necessary that I should be informed without
                    delay whether the scheme mentioned in my letter 14th<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d423-f1"/> instant to Mr. Adee finds no objection.</p>
                <p>I ask in favor of the agent of the Italian consulate but the same admission to
                    Barge Office under under the same conditions granted to the agent of the
                    Austrian consulate.</p>
                <p>Please wire me. Thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Baron Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
